    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/db71b0a3dcfae1f9a9b0e8bf2ba1ad37.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><br>Everything started some months ago that a terrible accident happened which made you fall in coma. Ever since then you are in a hospital not able to wake up or even remember who you are. You will have to search deep inside your subconscious where all the truth about who you are is hidden. You will have to be brave and put all the pieces of the puzzle together by visiting your past and fighting the monsters that you were hidding from all the others in your whole life. If you don't manage to make it you will never wake up and never learn who you are and the power hidden deep inside of you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are You Ready to Face Your Own Mind?</h2></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/ebb8f0229a896e9f26104ca8e2f6bf7d.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Will Have to Face Monsters,</h2></h2></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/6d36faab539de1f1620801c7e4586efc.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/642d0f3d39175a53fe6e24c261881dcd.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">talk with your past,</h2></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/beb11db3efc799aeb11b5227ffadcd3f.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">collect objects that were important to your old self,</h2></h2></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/2571044d4cbcb6b3418833a76d3467af.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/5e8feeba89c65cde4f678d9e388d19fb.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">explore.</h2></h2></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/f9151467691be29d2b9af2ac85d589c5.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063260/extras/14754a2aa4d700ada26e5eef03a8a296.avif?t=1660522584\" /></div><br>Will you be able to retrieve your memory and become who you were? Or will you never wake up?",
